{"id":"dac20a4480035106","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-order2-least-element.md","title":"ZFC Order2 Least Element","display":"df-zfc-order2-least-element — ZFC Order2 Least Element","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order2-least-element","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order2-least-element","58-df-zfc-order6-least-element"],"display":"df-zfc-order2-least-element — ZFC Order2 Least Element","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order2-least-element"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order2-least-element</span><span>58-df-zfc-order6-least-element</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order2-least-element — ZFC Order2 Least Element"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq P\">\\(A\\subseteq P\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in P\">\\(m\\in P\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2LeastElement}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6LeastElement}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2LeastElement}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6LeastElement}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}least\\text{-}element}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2LeastElement}_S(m,A;P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land A\\subseteq P\\\\\n&amp;\\land m\\in A\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(m\\leq_P a).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}least\\text{-}element}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2LeastElement}_S(m,A;P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land A\\subseteq P\\\\\n&amp;\\land m\\in A\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(m\\leq_P a).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}least\\text{-}element}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6LeastElement}_S(X,R,A,l)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2LeastElement}_S(l,A;X,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}least\\text{-}element}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6LeastElement}_S(X,R,A,l)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2LeastElement}_S(l,A;X,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient carrier and order are part of the definition rather than\nimplicit in an untyped comparison symbol.</li>\n<li>The order6 least-element variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)$, $A\\subseteq P$, and $m\\in P$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2LeastElement}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6LeastElement}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}least\\text{-}element}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2LeastElement}_S(m,A;P,\\leq_P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land A\\subseteq P\\\\\n&\\land m\\in A\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(m\\leq_P a).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}least\\text{-}element}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6LeastElement}_S(X,R,A,l)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2LeastElement}_S(l,A;X,R).","display":true}],"bytes":1255,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2936","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-order2-least-element.md|58-df-zfc-order2-least-element]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["2aa29158e60b337f"]}